* Components
Vin 1 0 DC
D1 3 0 Dmodel
D2 1 2 Dmodel
D3 5 3 Dmodel
D4 2 0 Dmodel
RL 3 6 100
C1 6 7 1uF

* Nodes
* 1 - Positive terminal of Vin
* 0 - Ground
* 2 - Node between D2 and D4
* 3 - Node at junction of D1, D3, and RL
* 5 - Node at anode of D3
* 6 - Node between RL and C1 
* 7 - Positive output node Vout

.model Dmodel D(IS=1n)

.end